<opsproc code="00008874.0001001" revdate="2016-08-10T18:25:18"><title>AFT Cargo Isolation Valve (Valves checked closed)</title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00008874.0001001.042"><title>Flight preparation/limitations</title><procbody lid="N.00008874.0001001.043"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008874.0001001.044"><para code="00008874.0001001.024" layer="1" lid="N.00008874.0001001.047">The <if-installed>AFT Cargo
Heating</if-installed> and the ventilation in the AFT cargo compartment
are not available.</para><para code="00008874.0001001.025" layer="1" lid="N.00008874.0001001.048">Ensure that the AFT cargo compartment
does not contain materials sensitive to important temperature variations
or sensitive to the lack of ventilation.</para></inform><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008874.0001001.050"><para code="00008874.0001001.022" layer="1" lid="N.00008874.0001001.045">In that respect, for live animal transportation,
use the Live Animal Transportation Calculation Tool.</para></inform></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00008874.0001001.004"><title>During cockpit preparation</title><procbody lid="N.00008874.0001001.005"><action layer="1" lid="N.00008874.0001001.007" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008874.0001001.002"><challenge><tech-label type="sel">ANN LT</tech-label></challenge><response>TEST</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00008874.0001001.008" memory="false"><command code="00008874.0001001.003"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008874.0001001.009">Check that the <tech-label type="pb-sw">AFT ISOL
VALVE</tech-label> <tech-label type="light">FAULT</tech-label> comes on.</para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00008874.0001001.010" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008874.0001001.004"><challenge><tech-label type="sel">ANN LT</tech-label></challenge><response>BRT or DIM</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00008874.0001001.011" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008874.0001001.005"><challenge><tech-label type="pb-sw">AFT ISOL VALVE</tech-label></challenge><response>OFF</response></cr-action></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00008874.0001001.012" memory="false"><command code="00008874.0001001.006"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008874.0001001.013">Check that the <tech-label type="pb-sw">AFT ISOL
VALVE</tech-label> <tech-label type="light">FAULT</tech-label> does not come on.</para></command></action><condition at-any-time="false" code="00008874.0001001.026" direct="false" layer="1" lid="N.00008874.0001001.049" subtitle="false" type="cond"><intro>If the  <tech-label type="pb-sw">AFT ISOL VALVE</tech-label> <tech-label type="light">FAULT</tech-label> comes
on:</intro><procbody lid="N.00008874.0001001.039"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008874.0001001.040"><para code="00008874.0001001.021" layer="1" lid="N.00008874.0001001.041">The AFT cargo isolation valves must be
secured in the closed position. <duref product="MMEL" ref="00007489"><linktext>Item 21-28-04B AFT Cargo Isolation Valve</linktext></duref></para></inform></procbody></condition><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008874.0001001.051"><para code="00008874.0001001.027" layer="1" lid="N.00008874.0001001.052">Disregard the <ecam-data ecamimportance="A" type="alert"><ecamsys>COND</ecamsys><ecamtitle>AFT CRG ISOL VALVE</ecamtitle></ecam-data> alert displayed on the <abb>EWD</abb>.</para></inform></procbody></procitem></opsproc>